    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Peanut Noodles\"\n  servings: 4\n  prep_time: \"26 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"106 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 cups dates\"\n    \"4 cups soy beans\"\n    \"2 cups rice paper\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Hearty limes and lamb stew, slow-cooked with cayenne pepper and kohlrabi for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Fresh albacore tuna with a pinch of tikka masala, topped by a caramelized rockmelon with whipped cream\"\n    \"Three fruit with kale, cabbage, artichoke, broccoli and ricemilk. With a side of baked tangelo, and your choice of bocconcini or lotus root.\"\n    \"Fresh mixed greens tossed with colombo-rubbed venison, asian greens, and a light dressing.\"\n    \"A juicy leeks creation, seasoned with cinnamon and french lavender, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"A special azure fennel seeds from Portugal. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of mango.\"\n    \"Hearty smoked trout and beef stew, slow-cooked with garlic and cos lettuce for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 596\n    protein: \"13g\"\n    carbs: \"36g\"\n    fat: \"7g\"\n  }\n}"
