  {
    num: "9862"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Eggplant And Jicama Stew\"\n  servings: 3\n  prep_time: \"58 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"37 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"1 cups starfruit\"\n    \"1 pieces lemongrass\"\n    \"2 cups flaxseed oil\"\n    \"1 oz edamame\"\n    \"3 oz chicken\"\n    \"1 tbsp parsley\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A special white brown rice from Singapore. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of bbq.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious venison and sweet corella pear, baked in a crunchy pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Our fresh beef, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed artichoke and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n    \"Three haloumi with bean shoots, carrot, pumpkin, zucchini and ajowan seed. With a side of baked tomato, and your choice of licorice or bran.\"\n    \"An exquisite pigeon roast, infused with the essence of cherry, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy cucumber\"\n    \"Baked currants-stuffed turkey, seasoned with jalfrezi and delicious herbs, accompanied by roasted chilli pepper medley.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 232\n    protein: \"41g\"\n    carbs: \"27g\"\n    fat: \"24g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
